# Mechanic: every card in a 20-card hand accepts pointer input.
# Forcing: 19 Forests precede Ornithopter, so the zero-cost cast sits rightmost.
# AI behavior: no hand or battlefield, so no opposing choices interrupt the cast.
# Failure modes: an unreachable rightmost card leaves Ornithopter in hand.
# Card roles: Forests fill the hand, Ornithopter is the castable rightmost card.
# Protocol path: Cast offer and response, resolution to the battlefield.
# Paired with: hand-reach-7.pzl, hand-reach-20.pzl and hand-reach-62.pzl.
